    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2419" root="برو" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البَرِيَّةٌ</span></b>  <i>The creation; as meaning the beings,</i>
or <i>things, that are created;</i> or, particularly,
<i>mankind;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الخَلْقُ</span>: originally with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>: (S:)
but not pronounced with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>: (IAth, TA in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">برى</span>:) or, accord. to Fr, if from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرًا</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرًى</span>, i. e.
“dust,” or “earth,” it is originally without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>:
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَايَا</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِيَّاتٌ</span>. (S.)

